{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"亲近曾真切安慰过他。此刻，那份安慰让他在依赖之中也感到片刻自在。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始体验到，亲近成为安稳的依靠后，仍能带来片刻自在。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文已确立亲近确实带来过安慰，因此担忧之后重新感到自在有心理依据，也让这次的欢喜有别于早先单纯的满足。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选8\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"亲近已成了他的安稳依靠。这份重要性反而加深了吸引，让他此刻更享受主动靠近的快意。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始体验到，越珍视亲近，主动靠近的吸引力也越强。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"前文的依赖感足以解释吸引力为何加深，另一种听法也支持欲望变得更强，但这一情绪走向比自在的转折更依赖推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选16\",\n        \"候选15\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "905739c8-f5ed-4dad-8d4c-487ab7526f0b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T020553017319Z", "elapsed_seconds": 161.922, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:08:34.951896+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "66e48a160ce0400b5839e80c00817506b3360848a09f9f2275e8b8edef3dcdc3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0